<h1 class="fw-bold">
About Leave Management System
</h1>

<p class="lead">
LMS is designed to simplify employee leave
management for organizations.
</p>

<p>
Employees can submit leave applications,
track their requests and manage their profiles.
Administrators can review requests and
approve or reject leaves.
</p>

<p>
The system uses Spring Boot, Spring Data JPA,
Hibernate and MySQL for reliable backend
and database management.
